# Dependencies (node_modules is ignored by Prettier by default; listed for clarity)
# Slash-less to match .gitignore, where the trailing slash genuinely matters. It does
# NOT matter here: Prettier globs the tree and filters path strings, and its globber
# does not descend symlinked directories at all, so neither form can leak. Kept
# identical only so the two files can't drift and the old form get copied back.
node_modules

# Vendored third-party library, committed verbatim so it stays diffable against
# upstream. Reformatting it would make the next version bump unreviewable.
public/vendor/

# npm-managed lockfile — leave formatting to npm
package-lock.json

# Large data / binaries (untracked, but guard local `prettier .` runs)
*.db
Energica_Manuals
obd-garage

# Editor
.idea/
